0.128 2026-09-21
 - refactored a real code-quality issue: Browser::CLI::execute_search
   applied the exact same non-breaking-space-aware whitespace-trim
   regex (D2B-086/D2B-127) independently in two places - once to
   --engine's single value, once inline inside the map for --engines'
