   parser=>sub{[]}}], runner=>FakeRunner->new()) with a >200-char
   non-CAPTCHA body returned {engine_used=>'duckduckgo', results=>[]}
   instead of dying with the aggregated 'All search engines failed: ...'
   message every other engine's identical case already produced. Removed
